 "script": [
  {
   "cue": [
    "title"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "小朋友们好！你今天心情怎么样？今天，我们来学表达情绪的单词。"
    },
    {
     "en": "feelings"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "map",
    "show:feeling",
    "focus:feeling"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "心里的感受，是感觉、情绪："
    },
    {
     "en": "feeling"
    },
    {
     "zh": "它来自第十七集学过的",
     "cue": [
      "alt:feeling"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "feel"
    },
    {
     "en": "How are you feeling?"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:happy",
    "edge:feeling>happy",
    "focus:happy"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "心里乐开了花，是开心的："
    },
    {
     "en": "happy"
    },
    {
     "en": "I'm happy!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:smile",
    "edge:happy>smile",
    "focus:smile"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "开心的时候，我们会微笑："
    },
    {
     "en": "smile"
    },
    {
     "en": "Smile!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:like",
    "edge:smile>like",
    "focus:like"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "看到喜欢的东西，眼睛都亮了。喜欢，英语是"
    },
    {
     "en": "like"
    },
    {
     "en": "I like you!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:excited",
    "edge:feeling>excited",
    "focus:excited"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "要去游乐园啦，激动得跳起来，是兴奋的："
    },
    {
     "en": "excited"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:surprised",
    "edge:feeling>surprised",
    "focus:surprised"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "没想到的事情发生了，眼睛瞪得圆圆的，是惊讶的："
    },
    {
     "en": "surprised"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:sudden",
    "edge:surprised>sudden",
    "focus:sudden"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "让人吃惊的事，常常是突然发生的："
    },
    {
     "en": "sudden"
    },
    {
     "zh": "加上 l y，就是突然地：",
     "cue": [
      "alt:sudden"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "suddenly"
    },
    {
     "en": "Suddenly, it rained!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:mad",
    "edge:feeling>mad",
    "focus:mad"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "气鼓鼓的，是生气的："
    },
    {
     "en": "mad"
    },
    {
     "en": "Don't be mad."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:sad",
    "edge:feeling>sad",
    "focus:sad"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "心里难过，是伤心的："
    },
    {
     "en": "sad"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:cry",
    "edge:sad>cry",
    "focus:cry"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "太伤心了，就会哭："
    },
    {
     "en": "cry"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:tears",
    "edge:cry>tears",
    "focus:tears"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "哭的时候，流下的是眼泪："
    },
    {
     "en": "tears"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:afraid",
    "focus:afraid"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "怕黑、怕打雷，是害怕的："
    },
    {
     "en": "afraid"
    },
    {
     "en": "I'm afraid of the dark."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:scared",
    "edge:afraid>scared",
    "focus:scared"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "被吓了一大跳，是吓坏的："
    },
    {
     "en": "scared"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:fear",
    "edge:scared>fear",
    "focus:fear"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "心里的害怕，叫恐惧："
    },
    {
     "en": "fear"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "focus:excited,surprised,scared"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "你发现了吗？好多表示感觉的词，都是 e d 结尾的："
    },
    {
     "en": "excited",
     "cue": [
      "focus:excited"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "surprised",
     "cue": [
      "focus:surprised"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "scared",
     "cue": [
      "focus:scared"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "focus:happy,sad"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "一开心，一伤心："
    },
    {
     "en": "happy",
     "cue": [
      "focus:happy"
     ]
    },
    {
     "en": "sad",
     "cue": [
      "focus:sad"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "focus:none"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "我们来做一做表情吧！"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [],
   "parts": [
    {
     "en": "Show me happy!",
     "cue": [
